OL,4,CBarber shop incident leaves man        
OL,5,Cseriously injured                      
OL,6,GA man has been arrested on suspicion   
OL,7,Gof attempted murder after another man  
OL,8,Gwas seriously injured at a barber shop 
OL,9,Gin Worcestershire.                     
OL,11,FWest Mercia Police were called to      
OL,12,FEmpire Barbers on Deansway, Worcester, 
OL,13,Fat about 15:15 GMT on Wednesday        
OL,14,Ffollowing reports that a man in his    
OL,15,F30s had been hurt.                     
OL,17,FHe was taken to hospital but his       
OL,18,Finjuries are not thought to be life    
OL,19,Fthreatening or life changing, police   
OL,20,Fsaid.                                  
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
