OL,4,CFamily pays tribute after supermarket  
OL,5,Cvan crash                              
OL,6,GThe family of a motorcyclist who died  
OL,7,Gfollowing a crash with a supermarket   
OL,8,Gdelivery van have paid tribute to a    
OL,9,G"free spirit" who will be missed       
OL,10,G"beyond all measure".                  
OL,12,FPhillip Brough, 46, known as Dean to   
OL,13,Fhis family, was riding a Kawasaki      
OL,14,Fmotorbike when he was involved in a    
OL,15,Fcollision at the junction of Deakin    
OL,16,FRoad and Chell Heath Road in Stoke-on- 
OL,17,FTrent shortly after 16:45 GMT on 13    
OL,18,FNovember.                              
OL,20,FDespite the efforts of emergency       
OL,21,Fservices, he died at the scene.        
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
