OL,4,CFallen tree cut off water to 8,500     
OL,5,Chomes                                  
OL,6,GA burst water pipe that left 8,500     
OL,7,Ghomes and businesses without running   
OL,8,Gwater was caused by a fallen tree, it  
OL,9,Ghas been confirmed.                    
OL,11,FA major outage affected residents in   
OL,12,FStourbridge in the West Midlands on    
OL,13,FWednesday, with around 8,500 homes and 
OL,14,Fbusinesses left with no water at the   
OL,15,Fpeak of the incident.                  
OL,17,F"We've identified the complex repair,  
OL,18,Fit's a tree that came down and its     
OL,19,Froots had damaged the pipe work so     
OL,20,Fwe're working on that," Howard Perry,  
OL,21,FSevern Trent Water's head of water     
OL,22,Fquality, told BBC Radio WM.       G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
