OL,4,C'I kept coach Bennell's abuse secret   
OL,5,Cuntil mum died'                        
OL,6,GA survivor of paedophile football      
OL,7,Gcoach Barry Bennell says he waited     
OL,8,Guntil his mother died before going to  
OL,9,Gthe police because he did not want to  
OL,10,Gburden her.                            
OL,12,FDavid Lean was among the boys abused   
OL,13,Fby the ex-Crewe Alexandra coach and    
OL,14,FManchester City scout, also known as   
OL,15,FRichard Jones, during the 1970s, 80s   
OL,16,Fand 90s.                               
OL,18,FBennell was jailed for more than 30    
OL,19,Fyears in 2018 after he was convicted   
OL,20,Fof 50 child sexual offences against 12 
OL,21,Fboys. He died in prison five years     
OL,22,Flater, aged 69.                   G4/4 
